@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title SEQ-05 - KHÁM PHÁ & LỰA CHỌN SẢN PHẨM
actor "Người dùng" as U
boundary "Shop UI" as UI
control "Store API" as API
control "Catalog Service" as S
control "Prisma Client" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
U -> UI : Mở Shop
UI -> API : GET /api/store/bootstrap
API -> S : loadCatalog()
S -> P : find active products + variants
P -> DB : SELECT Product/Variant
S --> API : catalog + settings
API --> UI : product list
UI -> UI : Search / filter / sort
U -> UI : Chọn sản phẩm
UI -> UI : Hiển thị detail
U -> UI : Chọn màu / size
UI -> UI : Cập nhật variant + stock
@enduml
